		{"id":"n_2009","type":"text","text":"**2009: Tang et al.**\n首个scRNA-seq\n手工挑管，单细胞测序元年","x":20,"y":40,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n_2012","type":"text","text":"**2012/2013: Smart-seq2**\n全长转录组，灵敏度高\n板式测序的金标准","x":20,"y":160,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n_2014","type":"text","text":"**2014: Nature Method of the Year**\n单细胞测序被评为年度方法","x":20,"y":280,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n_2015","type":"text","text":"**2015: Drop-seq & inDrop**\n利用微流控液滴封装细胞\n通量跃升至数千细胞","x":470,"y":40,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n_2016","type":"text","text":"**2016: 10x Genomics**\nChromium系统发布\n商业化成功，行业爆发","x":470,"y":160,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n_2017_split","type":"text","text":"**2017: Split-seq / sci-RNA-seq**\n组合索引技术 (Combinatorial Indexing)\n无需昂贵仪器，扩展性极强","x":470,"y":280,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n_2017_cite","type":"text","text":"**2017: CITE-seq**\nRNA + 表面蛋白 (ADT)\n基因与蛋白共测","x":920,"y":40,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n_2018_atac","type":"text","text":"**2018/2019: scATAC-seq & Multiome**\n染色质开放性 + RNA\n表观遗传调控机制","x":920,"y":160,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n_spatial","type":"text","text":"**2020: 空间转录组 (Spatial)**\nNature Method of the Year\n保留组织空间位置信息 (Visium, Stereo-seq)","x":920,"y":280,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n_ai","type":"text","text":"**2023+: AI Foundation Models**\nscGPT, Geneformer\n单细胞大模型时代","x":920,"y":400,"width":360,"height":100},
		{"id":"n1","type":"text","text":"# 单细胞组学发展简史\n从手工挑取到百万级吞吐量","x":0,"y":-260,"width":1300,"height":100,"color":"1"}
